QuestGuidance.Register("en",254,{
[8097]="70030EF5\n1\tRecover fish from Orcs (total: 8)\tThe docks can be found to the south-east of Snowbourn. Sigeric is concerned for the health of the city and wishes for you to recover fish from the Orcs that have been spotted by the docks near Snowbourn.\n2\tTalk to Gísling\tGísling can be found in northern Snowbourn. Sigeric told you to bring the fish you collected to Gísling.\n",
[8098]="7006C6E7\n1\tSpeak with Ashâmi at her post near Raphûz in Ub Nishir\tRaphûz thanked you for your guidance and camaraderie through his journey. He aspires to be like you now. He added that you should speak with Ashâmi, also in Ub Nishir, as she wants to speak with you too.\n2\tSpeak with Raphûz at his post near Ashâmi in Ub Nishir\tAshâmi credits you with making her a better person and guiding her and Raphûz into the relationship and fate they have chosen. Raphûz had mentioned you should return to him at Ub Nishir after speaking with Ashâmi.\n",
[8099]="70054672\n1\tFire loaded ballistae (total: 7)\tLoaded ballistae can be found in the Circle of Madness. You should fire loaded ballistae at flying merrevail.\n2\tTalk to Rhadrog\tRhadrog is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Rhadrog.\n",
[8100]="7005AB12\n1\tDefeat goblin looters (total: 6)\tGoblin looters have been spotted stealing from the ice-giants in Thyrstáth. You should defeat goblin looters.\n2\tCall Hórin and talk to him or speak to him back at Fellgát\tUse the summoning horn to call Hórin to your side. You should talk to Hórin. If Hórin is no longer with you, you can find him at Fellgát.\n",
[8101]="70000D8E\n1\tTalk to Hyacinth Took\tHyacinth Took is in Tuckborough, west of the Great Smials. Lobelia Sackville-Baggins has heard that Hyacinth Took knows the art of making fireworks and asked that you place an order for her biggest and brightest.\n2\tTalk to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins\tLobelia Sackville-Baggins is at her home at Bag End in Hobbiton. Lobelia Sackville-Baggins sent you to order fireworks from Hyacinth Took, but Hyacinth informed you that she was out of both fireworks and the materials to make them. She told you to return to Hobbiton and make sure Lobelia will be expected to pay for the materials, if she still wants fireworks.\n3\tBring the coinpurse to Hyacinth Took\tHyacinth Took is west of the Great Smials in Tuckborough. Hyacinth Took sent you back to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins to request payment for the ingredients to make her fireworks. Lobelia reluctantly agreed and gave you a coinpurse to take back to Hyacinth.\n",
[8102]="70000D07\n1\tPick up the pie\tOpal Goodbody is at the Party Field, north of Hobbiton and south of Bag End. When you returned from delivering a pie to The Green Dragon, Holly Hornblower had another delivery task waiting for you: she has asked you to take the pie she baked for Lobelia Sackville-Baggins's birthday party to Opal Goodbody at the Party Field in Hobbiton, south of Bag End and north of the town proper. Make sure that no hungry hobbits catch a whiff of the pie, or they will be pestering Holly for a slice! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Holly Hornblower\tHolly Hornblower can be found north of the main square of Hobbiton and south of the Party Field. When you delivered the pie to Opal Goodbody, she tasted it and found that it tasted awful. She demanded a new one from Holly Hornblower. You should return to Holly at once.\n",
[8103]="7005F6BC\n1\tDefeat Angmarim of the Iron Crown at Lochan Dúv\tAngmarim of the Iron Crown can be found at Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn. Lochan Dúv is the chief encampment of the Iron Crown in Gloomingtarn. You should defeat Angmarim of the Iron Crown and drive them from Mount Gundabad.\n2\tDefeat Angmarim of the Iron Crown at Lochan Dúv (total: 12)\tAngmarim of the Iron Crown can be found at Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn. Lochan Dúv is the chief encampment of the Iron Crown in Gloomingtarn. You should defeat Angmarim of the Iron Crown and drive them from Mount Gundabad.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Angmarim of the Iron Crown at Lochan Dúv.\n",
[8104]="70047DB5\n1\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast Strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth. If you have a lock-pick, you should attempt to open the strongbox.\n",
[8105]="70047DBC\n1\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast Strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth. If you have a lock-pick, you should attempt to open the strongbox.\n",
[8106]="700490FF\n1\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth. If you have a lock-pick, you should attempt to open the strongbox.\n",
[8107]="70049100\n1\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tObtain a lock-pick and open the Udûn-cast strongbox\tUdûn-cast strongboxes can be found somewhere in the depths of Skoironk or within the Towers of the Teeth. If you have a lock-pick, you should attempt to open the strongbox.\n",
[8108]="7003FE68\n1\tLock chests (total: 6)\tThe chests within the mason should be locked to prevent the corsairs from getting the contents within.\n",
[8109]="70065E94\n1\tTell Gladion you will help him with his work\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. Speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.\n2\tRepair the squeaky chairs (total: 2)\030Repair the broken ladder (quantity: see journal)\tGladion's farm is in northern Lamedon. Repair damaged furniture at Gladion's farm.\n3\tAsk Gladion what else he needs\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. Speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.\n4\tPull weeds (total: 5)\030Pick stones (total: 6)\tWeeds and stones can be found on Gladion's family's farmland. Pick weeds and stones from Gladion's farmland.\n5\tReturn to Gladion\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. You should return to Gladion.\n",
[8110]="7003FE3A\n1\tTell Gladion you will help him with his work\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. You should speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.\n2\tRepair the squeaky chairs (total: 2)\030Repair the broken ladder (quantity: see journal)\tGladion's farm is in northern Lamedon. You should repair damaged furniture at Gladion's farm.\n3\tAsk Gladion what else he needs\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. You should speak with Gladion about the help he needs on his farm.\n4\tHarvest wheat from the fields (total: 3)\030Pick cabbages (total: 5)\030Collect the carrots for delivery (quantity: see journal)\tThe wheat and cabbages can be harvested from the fields at Gladion's farmstead. The crate of carrots is on Gladion's farm, and should be carried to the Calembel-bound waggon in the centre of the village. You should harvest the crops and carry the carrots to the waggon.\n5\tReturn to Gladion\tGladion is at his farm in northern Lamedon. You should return to Gladion.\n",
[8111]="70025C03\n1\tCollect dry logs (total: 8)\tNan Orngon is east of Ost Forod. Poppy Seaton has asked you to venture to Nan Orngon and collect dried logs.\n2\tBring dry logs to Poppy Seaton at Ost Forod\tPoppy Seaton is at Ost Forod, west of Nan Orngon. Poppy Seaton will be pleased to see all of the wood you collected.\n",
[8112]="7005CE67\n1\tTalk to Kyrstig near the Houses of Rest\tYou should find Kyrstig and help investigate the Houses of Rest.\n2\tComplete 'Discovery: Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest'\tYou should seek out the entrance to Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest.\n3\tComplete Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest, on any difficulty\tYou should complete Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest, on any difficulty.\n4\tTalk to Kyrstig in Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest\tYou should report to Kyrstig at once.\n5\tTalk to Scout-master Ausma\tAusma is waiting for your report.\n",
[8113]="7000186C\n1\tTalk to Londrandir\tLondrandir stands at Gatson's Farm in the Kingsfell. You should speak with Londrandir.\n2\tTalk to Lachenn or Aglardir at Meluinen\tLachenn and Aglardir are at Lin Giliath in Meluinen, south of Esteldín. Since it is clear that the Rangers have their own burdens to bear, Londrandir has asked you to journey east to speak with Lachenn, the Master of Lin Giliath. If Lachenn is unavailable, he told you to speak instead with Aglardir.\n",
[8114]="7002542E\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth to gain rep.\n",
[8115]="70025430\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth to gain rep.\n",
[8116]="7002542F\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth to gain rep.\n",
[8117]="70025431\n1\tSpeak with Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth to gain rep.\n",
[8118]="70000DD5\n1\tFind a wild hive before the salve dries\tFarmer Proudfoot is guarding his hives in the meadow south-east of Tuckborough. The wild beehives you are looking for are in a bear-infested area further south-east past the meadow. Farmer Proudfoot sent you to Gammer Boffin in Overhill to obtain some balm to keep off the bees, so you can collect a hive for him. Gammer Boffin warned you that the salve will not last long, so you will need to collect the hive as soon as possible and take it to Polo Proudfoot.\n2\tTalk to Polo Proudfoot\tPolo Proudfoot would like to take a moment to thank you for your efforts.\n",
[8119]="7006056E\n1\tTalk to Prestadír in Tornhad\tThe Ranger Prestadír is in Tornhad, seeking to ease Ravaedron's worries.\n2\tMeet up with Prestadír outside the ruins of Eitheldir, north of Tornhad\tPrestadír asked to meet you outside the ruins of Eitheldir, to the north of Tornhad.\n3\tTalk to Prestadír outside the ruins of Eitheldir\tPrestadír is outside the ruins of Eitheldir, north of Tornhad.\n4\tTalk to Prestadír and patrol the ruins of Eitheldir\tPrestadír is outside the ruins of Eitheldir, north of Tornhad.\n5\tTalk to Prestadír outside the ruins of Eitheldir\tPrestadír is outside the ruins of Eitheldir, north of Tornhad.\n6\tTalk to Ravaedron in Tornhad\tRavaedron is at Tornhad, the encampment of the Rangers, south of Eitheldir.\n",
[8120]="700006C0\n1\tDefeat Créoth apprentices and disciples (total: 10)\030Defeat Créoth wardens (total: 6)\030Defeat Créoth chieftains (total: 6)\tThe Hillmen of Rhudaur occupy the ancient ruins called Garth Agarwen in the north-east of Agamaur. Adherents follow the Red-maid but are not truly Hillmen, they are drawn from the the Grim Créoth, Créoth Apprentices and the Créoth Disciples. The devoted are drawn from the Créoth Devout and Créoth Wardens. Lastly, the masters are drawn from the Créoth Chieftains and Leaders. The shade explained that the Rhudaur were responsible for raising the Red-maid, an evil creature of great power, and were in some way also responsible for the curse that holds the shades of Arthedain in Middle-earth. He has asked you to destroy the Hillmen, allowing him and his brethren to fulfil their curse.\n2\tTalk to Emelin\tEmelin resides with his brethren in the southernmost reaches of the Harloeg. You were sent to destroy the Hillmen of Rhudaur who dwell within Garth Agarwen. Your victory was not complete, but you struck a telling blow against the Hillmen. Emelin should be told of your efforts.\n",
[8121]="7002EFBE\n1\tTalk to Ramdir beneath the shadow of the Argonath\tRamdir wants to speak with you in the shadow of the Argonath, north along the Anduin. Ramdir has wanted to gaze upon the Pillars of the Kings for many years, and he has asked to meet you at a place where he has a good vantage point of them.\n",
[8122]="700018D8\n1\tFind an aurochs-yearling\tAurochs yearlings can be found amidst the small herd to the south-east of Gatson's farm. Gilmar, Gatson's farmhand, has asked you to pick out an aurochs-yearling from the local herd and drive it over to his pasture.\n2\tTalk to Gilmar\tGilmar is back on Gatson's farm. You have brought the aurochs-yearling to Gatson's pasture, now you should return to Gilmar to tell him of your success.\n",
[8123]="700514F5\n1\tTalk to the Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster\tTalk to the Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster to trade Longbeard Marks for Motes. This quest can be completed weekly.\n",
[8124]="700514F6\n1\tTalk to the Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster\tTalk to the Dwarf-holds Rewards Quartermaster to trade Longbeard Marks for Motes. This quest can be completed weekly.\n",
[8125]="70022D5F\n1\tTalk to Heithur Ironfist in the Trollshaws\tThe camp written about in the message is located south-east of the Last Bridge a short distance off of the road. You will see the hills rise sharply and a small cliff surrounded by pillar-like stones. Heithur must be there. A dwarf, Heithur Ironfist, sent a message to any soul who would come to his aid in the Trollshaws.\n",
[8126]="700266DB\n1\tCollect longbows from Tham Laegamon (total: 8)\tTham Laegamon is to the south-west of the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Rodlam asked you to venture to Tham Laegamon and gather longbows from the tomb-robbers there.\n2\tBring the longbows to Rodlam\tRodlam is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Rodlam will want to see the longbows you collected from Tham Laegamon.\n",
[8127]="70000DB7\n1\tTalk to Longo Burrow\tLongo Burrow is at his farm on the Stock Road, east out of Tuckborough. Upset greatly by her cousin's disappearance, Esilia Took has asked you to speak with Longo Burrow to learn if he has seen Gerebert.\n",
[8128]="70000DBD\n1\tSearch for Longo's missing waggon\tLongo's waggon may be at the Stock Road clearing due west of Woodhall, by the Wellbridge. Rollo Boffin did not have any information specifically about Gerebert Took, but now wonders if Gerebert's disappearance and the disappearance of Longo Burrow's waggon are somehow connected. He has asked you to go search a clearing just off the Stock Road for any sign of the missing waggon.\n2\tTalk to Rollo Boffin\tRollo Boffin can be found in the centre of Woodhall. At the Stock Road clearing, you found an abandoned waggon. Your examination of the waggon revealed that it once carried pipe-weed, but all the pipe-weed was removed and carried off to the south.\n",
})
